                  "type": "text",
                  "text": "theorem the_generated_closure_partitions_into_three_kinds : (1521705 + 449 + 431173 = 1953327) ∧ ((1521705 > 3 * 431173) ∧ (1521705 < 4 * 431173)) := by decide"
